  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "The rate constant for a first order reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The time required for the initial concentration of the reactant to reduce to its <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac></math> level is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math>. (Nearest integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "17",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For a first order reaction, we know:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>03465</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math><br />From the relation of half lives(where &#39;n&#39; is the no. of half-lives):</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p>Thus, No. of Half life <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>Time required <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>03465</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>17325</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>325</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
